The manuscript text and derived artifacts — paper/Paper.MD, paper/build.py,
paper/submission/*.tex, paper/submission/*.pdf, paper/submission/*.docx —
are licensed under:

**Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)**
Copyright © 2026 Bowen Gu

See https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/ for the full legal text.

---

## Verilog HDL sources and PCB hardware designs

All files under HDL/, paper/HDL/ and pcb/ are licensed under:

**CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 — Strongly Reciprocal
(CERN-OHL-S)**
Copyright © 2026 Bowen Gu

See https://ohwr.org/project/cernohl/wikis/Documents/CERN-OHL-version-2
for the full legal text.

---

## All other files

All other files in this repository not covered above — including but not
limited to shell.nix, sim/, implementations/, docs/, README.md, TLDR.md,
AGENTS.md, and .gitignore — are licensed under:

**GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later (AGPL-3.0-or-later)**
Copyright © 2026 Bowen Gu

See https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html for the full legal text.
